# Git Workflow — Atomic, traceable commits
When executing tasks:
- Stage ONLY the files relevant to the current step.
- Use commit message format: "<task id>: <step> — <why this change>".
- Push only after tests pass.
- If blocked, do not commit. Document blockers in /ops/workflow_state.md and stop.

When opening PRs:
- Title: "<task id> <short title>"
- Description: list acceptance criteria and how they were verified.